{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mate in Eleven (#M11)</strong>\u00a0is Yet Another entry in the auto-battler (auto-chess?) format.<br><br>M11 offers a unique twist of engine-based &quot;<strong>Perfect Combat</strong>&quot; to the auto-battler, which takes frustration out of the equation.<br><br>No watching your queen int into the enemy backline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tacticians can enjoy the tight timers during shopping phases to allow for multiple layers of strategic preparations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ranked matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Custom lobbies (up to 8 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add bots to those lobbies for full games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combat with engine lines for every position</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tooltip-based tutorial (so you can jump right into the action)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3857870?t=1753462697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857870/317a720401cb55028af2c249060973a6613440b7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753462697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857870/77da69021df3d2c3733c2bbc33e5a8f9540fbdb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753462697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857870/77da69021df3d2c3733c2bbc33e5a8f9540fbdb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753462697","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Mate in Eleven (#M11)</strong>\u00a0is Yet Another entry in the auto-b